Note: nested if/else + loop with conditional accumulation
Function classify takes n
    If n < 0
        Return "negative"
    Otherwise if n equals 0
        Return "zero"
    Otherwise
        Return "positive"
    End
End
For each v in [-2, 0, 5]
    Say to_string(v) + " is " + classify(v)
End
evens = 0
For i from 1 to 10
    If i mod 2 equals 0
        evens = evens + 1
    End
End
Say "evens in 1..10: " + evens
